[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13860.07, "timestamp": "03:51:00", "text": "我当时想，哦，等等，还有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13861.91, "timestamp": "03:51:01", "text": "阳光明媚。我认为我们可以一起上大学。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13863.51, "timestamp": "03:51:03", "text": "和平。然后，当我们正要离开的时候……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13871.91, "timestamp": "03:51:11", "text": "是的。路况怎么样？是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13874.229, "timestamp": "03:51:14", "text": "像这样吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13876.07, "timestamp": "03:51:16", "text": "事实上，自从我上大学以来，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13877.59, "timestamp": "03:51:17", "text": "我们住的公寓有点……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13879.269, "timestamp": "03:51:19", "text": "就像在偏远的地方一样。所以，我们不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13881.83, "timestamp": "03:51:21", "text": "存在这些问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13884.87, "timestamp": "03:51:24", "text": "除了你知道的那种感觉之外"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13887.59, "timestamp": "03:51:27", "text": "就像不得不走进雨中一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13890.389, "timestamp": "03:51:30", "text": "雨中出行仅涉及这些问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13895.03, "timestamp": "03:51:35", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13897.51, "timestamp": "03:51:37", "text": "是的。所以，基本上就是这样。就像我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13899.189, "timestamp": "03:51:39", "text": "房间里甚至还开玩笑说我们根本不在乎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13900.79, "timestamp": "03:51:40", "text": "下次洗澡前得洗个澡了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13906.95, "timestamp": "03:51:46", "text": "是的，因为我们会投入这么多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13908.55, "timestamp": "03:51:48", "text": "就像会被淋雨一样，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13910.63, "timestamp": "03:51:50", "text": "即使带着自行车，骑自行车旅行也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13912.389, "timestamp": "03:51:52", "text": "大概需要5分钟。想象一下5"}]